        "### D.3 Confusion matrix, in counts and in dollars\n",
        "The rubric asks for standard performance measures as well as the task metric. The out-of-fold probabilities of the leading model are turned into decisions with the personal cut-off and with 0.5, and compared with what residents actually did."
